|CKBCleric of Mitra|000

|CK0Mitra's Clerics are holy healers and defensive battle-priests. They protect
and strengthen companions, remove dangerous afflictions, and bring divine
force against evil rather than relying on a pure damage rotation.|000

|CKBHow it plays|000
|CK0A Cleric shifts between triage, prevention, and punishment. Healing and
renewal keep allies standing; blessings, insulation, holy light, and summoned
guardians prepare a group for danger. At the highest levels, a Cleric can even
restore the dead to life.|000

|CKBCore skills|000
|CK0cure and renew restore allies, bless and insulate provide protection,
hammer creates the guild's sacred weapon, sunray and flamestrike attack evil,
turn repels undead, and resurrect returns a fallen adventurer.|000

|CKBBest fit|000
|CK0Choose Cleric if you want a supportive caster who can fight, value group
survival and utility, and are comfortable serving Mitra and opposing evil.
Clerics share faith, facilities, and purpose with Mitra's Paladins.|000

|CK0After joining, use |CKBclerics|CK0 and the Cleric help topics for spell and
service details.|000

